          "comment": "[Playbook] Section 3.4 gives HDI an uncapped right to inspect our payment records, so we have added a once-per-twelve-month limit, confirmed the inspector is bound by the Section 8 confidentiality obligations, and confirmed the review covers records only and not access to our computer systems. We are content to leave the existing 30-day notice, business-hours and HDI-borne-cost terms unchanged; if frequency is an issue we could accept twice per year on the same conditions.",
